# === LFE Runtime ===
# `.plans/` itself is committed (with .gitkeep) so the coordination directory exists on clone,
# but the per-mission coordination files inside it are transient — they're never committed in steady state.
# The .gitkeep file marks the directory; mid-mission files (`01_grill_summary.md`, etc.)
# should not be committed because they only exist during an active session.
.plans/*
!.plans/.gitkeep

# === Enforcement Hardening (ADR 95) ===
# Private warn-and-log telemetry for the enforcement gates. Local observation
# only — never committed (no repo-history noise; avoids leaking local paths).
.claude/enforcement-telemetry.jsonl
